"1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="text-gray-1100 size-6"><path d="m21.62 21.5-7.47-10.9 6.97-8.1H18.7l-5.62 6.54L8.6 2.5H2.48L9.68 13l-7.3 8.5H4.8l5.96-6.93 4.76 6.93zM7.8 4.03l10.93 15.94H16.3L5.38 4.03z"></path></svg></a><button data-slot="xds-button" aria-label="Back" type="button" class="group relative inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium select-none transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-70 h-8 min-w-8 text-subtext1 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 text-primary hover:bg-btn-ghost-hover aria-expanded:bg-btn-ghost-hover active:bg-btn-ghost-pressed w-8 px-0 [&amp;_svg]:transition-transform [&amp;_svg]:duration-200 group-hover:[&amp;_svg]:scale-110" style="border-radius:9999px"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity opacity-0"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="animate-spin size-4 text-[color:inherit]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap" style="opacity:1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-arrow-left" viewBox="0 0 24 24" display="flex" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12.41 6-5 5H20v2H7.41l5 5L11 19.41 3.59 12 11 4.59z"></path></svg></span></button><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col ms-3"><h2 class="text-headline1 text-gray-1100 truncate font-extrabold">Post</h2></div></div><div class="mid:hidden"><div class="ms-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><a class="text-gray-1100 flex h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent px-3 text-[14px] font-bold transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 active:bg-gray-100" data-interaction="mobile-top-bar-log-in" href="/i/jf/onboarding/web?mode=login&amp;redirect_after_login=%2FZTZZBTC%2Fstatus%2F2014993622031344095">Log in</a><a class="bg-gray-1100 hover:bg-gray-1100/90 dark:text-gray-1100 flex h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-4 text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition-colors dark:bg-gray-100" href="/i/jf/onboarding/web?mode=signup&amp;redirect_after_login=%2FZTZZBTC%2Fstatus%2F2014993622031344095">Sign up</a></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--$--><h1 class="sr-only">ZTZZ ฿ on X: &quot;玩了@coolish 和 @CryptoPainter  推荐的Insider trading《内幕交易》
我在最后一周天天拉1.5倍起步，过关要求3200美金，我打了个33715美金。
这游戏还是很有意思的，把K线涨跌和特殊事件，结合了ROUGELIKE，分成涨和跌两种牌，以及不同的牌种类。需要合理安排牌序，来完成目标。
我到觉得这个游戏不是庄家模拟器，因为庄家实际操盘过程中的一些麻烦，并没有完全提现出来。他真的很像名字：内幕交易。
你知道一些内幕，但是不多，你比韭菜强一点，但也只能猜测庄家的衣角。
我严正声明：我们做市的比这个难多啦哈哈哈。
这个游戏最有意思的一点，其实是把市场涨跌和随机事件给安排到牌里。你的牌里如果花了太多的拉盘牌，之后出现下跌牌的概率就会变大。这其实就是拉盘之后，抛压变大。
如果你把上涨和下跌牌，连续排列，就会触发连击！上涨和下跌的幅度就会更大，这其实是暗示了趋势出现时，连续的单边趋势会放大人们的情绪！造成更大的波动。
牌库里还有各种黑天鹅牌，以及宏观市场的随机事件。

我作为一个半吊子的桌游设计师，一直想有空的时候设计一款自己的，和交易有关的游戏，我很清楚其中的设计难度。不论怎么说，这都是我目前玩到的非常好的交易游戏了。
我向大家再推荐一款桌游——《并购ACQUIRE》。同样是金融模仿领域游戏的巅峰作品。&quot;</h1><!--$?--><template id="B:0"></template><!--$--><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/ZTZZBTC" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@ZTZZBTC" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_400x400.jpg 400w"/></div></a></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-start min-w-0"><span class="flex max-w-full min-w-0 shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inhe