ne-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-70 h-8 min-w-8 text-subtext1 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 text-primary hover:bg-btn-ghost-hover aria-expanded:bg-btn-ghost-hover active:bg-btn-ghost-pressed w-8 px-0 [&amp;_svg]:transition-transform [&amp;_svg]:duration-200 group-hover:[&amp;_svg]:scale-110 -my-2 shrink-0" style="border-radius:9999px"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity opacity-0"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="animate-spin size-4 text-[color:inherit]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap" style="opacity:1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-more" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2zm9 2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2zm7 0c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">玩了</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/coolish">@<!-- -->coolish</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 和 </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/CryptoPainter">@<!-- -->CryptoPainter</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">  推荐的Insider trading《内幕交易》
我在最后一周天天拉1.5倍起步，过关要求3200美金，我打了个33715美金。
这游戏还是很有意思的，把K线涨跌和特殊事件，结合了ROUGELIKE，分成涨和跌两种牌，以及不同的牌种类。需要合理安排牌序，来完成目标。
我到觉得这个游戏不是庄家模拟器，因为庄家实际操盘过程中的一些麻烦，并没有完全提现出来。他真的很像名字：内幕交易。
你知道一些内幕，但是不多，你比韭菜强一点，但也只能猜测庄家的衣角。
我严正声明：我们做市的比这个难多啦哈哈哈。
这个游戏最有意思的一点，其实是把市场涨跌和随机事件给安排到牌里。你的牌里如果花了太多的拉盘牌，之后出现下跌牌的概率就会变大。这其实就是拉盘之后，抛压变大。
如果你把上涨和下跌牌，连续排列，就会触发连击！上涨和下跌的幅度就会更大，这其实是暗示了趋势出现时，连续的单边趋势会放大人们的情绪！造成更大的波动。
牌库里还有各种黑天鹅牌，以及宏观市场的随机事件。

我作为一个半吊子的桌游设计师，一直想有空的时候设计一款自己的，和交易有关的游戏，我很清楚其中的设计难度。不论怎么说，这都是我目前玩到的非常好的交易游戏了。
我向大家再推荐一款桌游——《并购ACQUIRE》。同样是金融模仿领域游戏的巅峰作品。</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative h-0" style="padding-bottom:68%"><div class="absolute -inset-0.5"><div class="group/carousel relative h-full"><div class="h-full w-full"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex overflow-x-auto gap-1 h-full snap-x snap-mandatory overscroll-x-contain py-0.5 -ms-3.5 -me-3.5 ps-4 pe-4"><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:1.1764705882352942"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/ZTZZBTC/status/2014993622031344095/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="high" height="2015" width="3653" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" decoding="async" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_adkGBbAAUuL7E?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_adkGBbAAUuL7E?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_adkGBbAAUuL7E?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_adkGBbAAUuL7E?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/ZTZZBTC/status/2014993622031344095/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:1.1764705882352942"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-